<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ food price index rises 0.4 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>NZ food price index rises 0.4 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Wednesday released the following data for the Food Price Index for October:</p>
<p>    Oct 1996	   Sept 1996	    Oct 1995</p>
<p>    +0.4 pct	   +0.7 pct	     +0.2 pct</p>
<p>yr-end Oct 1996  yr-end Sept 1996  yr-end Oct 1995</p>
<p>    +3.2 pct	   +3.1 pct	     +0.4 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI). -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
